WEBVTT

1
00:00:03.000 --> 00:00:05.120
What can a quiet conversation do?

2
00:00:05.840 --> 00:00:06.820
In Acts eighteen,

3
00:00:07.320 --> 00:00:09.900
Apollos speaks boldly and knows the Scriptures.

4
00:00:10.540 --> 00:00:12.980
Yet his understanding still needs help.

5
00:00:13.680 --> 00:00:15.240
Priscilla and Aquila hear him.

6
00:00:15.660 --> 00:00:17.340
They take him aside and explain

7
00:00:17.340 --> 00:00:18.940
the way of God more accurately.

8
00:00:19.600 --> 00:00:21.720
They give careful attention to a person.

9
00:00:22.340 --> 00:00:22.660
Later,

10
00:00:22.940 --> 00:00:24.840
Apollos greatly helps believers,

11
00:00:25.180 --> 00:00:27.320
showing from Scripture that Jesus is

12
00:00:27.320 --> 00:00:27.820
the Christ.

13
00:00:27.820 --> 00:00:31.080
The couple Paul calls fellow workers serves

14
00:00:31.080 --> 00:00:32.580
through patient instruction.

15
00:00:33.220 --> 00:00:35.920
An ordinary conversation becomes part of another

16
00:00:35.920 --> 00:00:37.580
person’s fruitful ministry.

17
00:00:38.240 --> 00:00:40.140
When someone needs help understanding Scripture,

18
00:00:40.920 --> 00:00:41.580
listen first.

19
00:00:42.180 --> 00:00:43.480
Open the passage together.

20
00:00:43.980 --> 00:00:45.100
Explain it with care.

21
00:00:45.700 --> 00:00:46.640
You do not need to see

22
00:00:46.640 --> 00:00:48.440
the whole future to be faithful

23
00:00:48.440 --> 00:00:49.340
in that moment.
